  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mesoamerican Health 2015 Panama - Second Individual Operation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Salud Mesoamrica 2015 Panam - Segunda Operacin Individual</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo es mejorar el acceso, cobertura, uso y calidad de los servicios de salud materna, reproductiva, neonatal e infantil en las comarcas indgenas de Guna Yala y Ember-Wounaan. A travs del conjunto de intervenciones planteadas se espera contribuir a la reduccin de la mortalidad materna, neonatal e infantil y la reduccin de la desnutricin crnica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this operation is to improve access, coverage, use and quality of services related to maternal health, reproductive health, neonatal care and infant care in the indigenous regions Guna Yala and Embera-Wounaan. Through a series of proposed interventions, the initiative seeks to reduce maternal and child mortality, and to reduce chronic malnutrition.</narrative>
  </description>
